===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|-elīn}}, {{m|gmh|-līn}}, from {{inh|de|goh|-ilī}}, {{m|goh|-ilīn}}, from {{inh|de|gmw-pro|*-ulīn|*-ilīn}}.<ref>{{R:EWddS|ed=22|hw=-lein}}</ref> Cognate to {{cog|nl|-lijn}}.

